re is nothing cooperative about it. You and 3 random mongoloids have several objectives to complete but playing as a team? That just doesn't exist. Nobody wants to pick up samples, nobody wants to be a big boy and solo side objectives, and nobody wants to be smart with their orbitals. \r\n\r\nI have been playing online pve and pvp games for 14 years and this game is the most frustrating one I've ever played 90% due to the players I play with. I don't blame a single one of my friends for not playing this bum ass game anymore. The devs don't know what the f**k they're doing and the players are all brain dead ret**ds.\r\n\r\nIf you don't purposely team kill randoms, you do pick up samples, and you do complete tasks by yourself then you my friend are a damn unicorn and deserve a pot of gold or something because holy sh*t, f**k this community.", "timestamp_created": 1772322368, "timestamp_updated": 1779984628, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219490776", "author": {"steamid": "76561198846334760", "personaname": "DylanNator", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198846334760/", "num_games_owned": 14, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 1122, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1122, "last_played": 1772210241, "avatar": "993d853160c3403ccd7dc20ef26ae9db2950ef7b"}, "language": "english", "review": "yes", "timestamp_created": 1772321897, "timestamp_updated": 1772321897, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "17073822